#====================================================================
# DRAFT-portaudio-19.7.0-harmonyos - Configure feature probing and no-device QA
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-portaudio-19.7.0-harmonyos
trigger_tool:           autotools|conan|portaudio|pthread
phase:                  configure|build|testing
error_signature:        pthread_cancel|PTHREAD_CANCELED|paqa_errs|host_apis=0

severity:               2
category:               autotools|pthread|audio|ohos
match_keywords:         AC_CHECK_FUNCS, HAVE_PTHREAD_CANCEL, pa_unix_util.c, paqa_errs, ALSA, JACK, OSS, ASIHPI
title:                  Probe pthread_cancel and document PortAudio no-device testing on OHOS

root_cause:             Target libc capability is a configure-time property; PTHREAD_CANCELED alone does not prove pthread_cancel links. Most upstream targets require audio backends or loopback hardware unavailable in the base OHOS gate.
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/p/portaudio/19.7.0 --build=missing; require paqa_errs to report 20 passed, 0 failed and execute the consumer API test.

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:            configure-feature-probe
rec_description:         Generate HAVE_PTHREAD_CANCEL with AC_CHECK_FUNCS and gate cancellation calls on that generated feature macro; keep the 48 hardware-dependent targets explicitly deferred.
rec_command:             AC_CHECK_FUNCS([pthread_cancel])
rec_auto_fix:             false
rec_impl:                 portability-patch|test-package|test-inventory

forbid_1_pattern:         __OHOS__.*pthread_cancel|ifdef __OHOS__
forbid_1_reason:          Platform-specific source macros hide the actual POSIX capability.
forbid_1_consequence:    A different libc can silently select the wrong cancellation path.

doc_file:                 knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-portaudio-19.7.0-harmonyos.md
last_updated:             2026-08-19
source_event:             portaudio/19.7.0 HarmonyOS PC adaptation, Issue #33
draft:                    true
contributor_id:           33
authors:                  xuguowei
